# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. An article,
# demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# ősz: adjective "(of hair) grey" (Wiktionary "ősz", Hungarian,
# adjective): "ősz haj", "ősz szakáll". The season takes the article or a
# case suffix: "az ősz", "ősszel".
ősz
